 "critic": "Repeated three-option requests, detachable explanations of why V was contacted, third-to-first-person seams, and interchangeable names made many cards read as assembled. Paying a stranger's loss often felt inserted to supply another option, while unfamiliar thieves supposedly proving a conspiracy weakened causality. The recurring Friday collection still supplied a credible local pressure. Ivo's refusal, approaching deadline, and neighbouring stalls' resistance formed the strongest connected sequence of choices and consequences.",
